==German==

===Etymology===
{{root|de|ine-pro|*bʰuH-}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|būwen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|būan}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*būaną}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*bʰúHt}}, the athematic root aorist of the root {{m|ine-pro|*bʰuH-}}. Cognates include {{cog|ang|būan}}, {{cog|non|búa}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|[ˈbaʊ̯ən]}}
* {{audio|de|De-bauen.ogg|Audio (Germany)}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-bauen.ogg|Audio (Austria)}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb-weak|baut|baute|gebaut}}

# to [[build]]; to [[construct]]
# (drug-related) to [[roll]] a [[joint]]
#: {{ux|de|Baust du einen? Ich kann grad nicht mehr.|Can you roll one? I just can't anymore.}}
# {{lb|de|with {{m|de|auf}}}} to [[rely]] (on)

